<title>USA: Philip Morris may issue $500 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Philip Morris may issue $500 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philip Morris Cos Inc is expected to issue a $500 million debt offering via Merrill Lynch &amp; Co one day this week, high-grade syndicate sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The A2/A rated deal is expected to consist of a noncallable 30-year maturity, sources added.</p>
<p>No further details were available on the offering.</p>
<p>(( --Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675))</p>
